{"channelId":"UC0EULefu_e-NHloVhMjm4ZA","row":["Odd-Paw Vet - Official Channel",76900,"🐾 Click for more Odd-Paw Vet: https://bit.ly/3XOAaS8\n\nOdd-Paw Vet welcomes viewers to the fantastical town of Odd Springs where odd is good and a range of super-cute hybrid animals reside including Kangaraffe (giraffe-kangaroo), Barrot (parrot-bear), Mummy and Baby Durtle (turtle-duck), Elefrog (elephant-frog), Pigoodle (pig-poodle), Drabbit (dragon-rabbit), and more. When these Odd-Paws need help, it’s up to Billie the Odd-Paw vet and her sidekicks to answer the call to care! \n\nOdd-Paw Vet follows the adventures of Billie, a young and talented animal doctor. In a world where animals have extraordinary combinations, Billie's days are filled with caring for a special group of animals called Odd-Paws.\nOdd-Paws are adorable hybrid animals that have a mix of features from different animals.\n\n\nWatch Brand New videos every Tuesday, Thursday and Saturday","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0EULefu_e-NHloVhMjm4ZA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0EULefu_e-NHloVhMjm4ZA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:27.717Z","channelId":"UC0EULefu_e-NHloVhMjm4ZA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"8f99f910c8cd3b77839d3c3f8c6e06dc6ad8566159b45d15f63cad3eb60e9ca5","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"24fc6b7118a306c3950afe612c3c47580f91dc0d5b8c951023ac81d8a493cbfc"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0EULefu_e-NHloVhMjm4ZA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:20:16.892Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0EULefu_e-NHloVhMjm4ZA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":76900,"raw":"76.9K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC0EULefu_e-NHloVhMjm4ZA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:27.717Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keywo